    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A casual digital card game with simple rules and a deep sense of challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eden Tactics&quot; can be played by anyone and with anyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eden Tactics&quot; is a competitive card game that can be played by anyone and everyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a &quot;character card&quot; with power from your hand,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The players compete to see how big or small the power of the card is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best card will win the game, taking into account your own hand and your opponent's hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Cards with a lot of personality].</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four colors of cards in this game: red, blue, green, and yellow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each color has its own unique ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Rule Manipulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow Use of discarded cards</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own original deck!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own original deck by collecting cards in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create a stable deck that makes the most of the individuality of one color,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create a stable deck that utilizes the individuality of one color, or a technical deck that utilizes the individuality of multiple colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own deck and make it the strongest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended for people who</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I like card games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I don't like difficult and complicated rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a tool to play easily with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who want to play heated battles by reading each other's cards.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A casual digital card game with simple rules and a deep sense of challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eden Tactics&quot; can be played by anyone and with anyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eden Tactics&quot; is a competitive card game that can be played by anyone and everyone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a &quot;character card&quot; with power from your hand,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The players compete to see how big or small the power of the card is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best card will win the game, taking into account your own hand and your opponent's hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Cards with a lot of personality].</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four colors of cards in this game: red, blue, green, and yellow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each color has its own unique ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Rule Manipulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow Use of discarded cards</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own original deck!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own original deck by collecting cards in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create a stable deck that makes the most of the individuality of one color,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create a stable deck that utilizes the individuality of one color, or a technical deck that utilizes the individuality of multiple colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own deck and make it the strongest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended for people who</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I like card games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I don't like difficult and complicated rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a tool to play easily with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who want to play heated battles by reading each other's cards.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Eden Tactics&quot; is a competitive digital card game. Simple rules and deep reading, casual digital cards for a new era. Read your opponent's hand and make the best move!",
